        "severity": "warning",
        "description": "Review these native object keys. Use HashMap or HashSet when reconstructed keys must match by value. Native Map and Set compare object keys by reference, so a newly constructed equal key misses the stored entry. Keep native collections for deliberate instance identity; Equal.byReference retains that identity behavior.",
